- **Laser safety:** Class 4 laser enclosure with interlocked access panels, beam tubes, and warning signage. Laser safety goggles OD > 5 at 532 nm for alignment. Emergency stop switch. Thermal management includes IR‑reflective coatings on critical optics and active air cooling.

